WEBVTT

00:00:09.120 --> 00:00:11.400
It's just as wonderful every time I read it.

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:13.340
<i>Sophia and the Emerald Princess</i>...

00:00:13.340 --> 00:00:16.560
A tale of the friendship between 
a princess and a commoner girl.

00:00:16.780 --> 00:00:19.050
It's just so beautiful!

00:00:21.950 --> 00:00:24.170
Lady Catarina, if I may...

00:00:25.610 --> 00:00:28.100
That same romance novel again?

00:00:28.100 --> 00:00:29.080
Yes.

00:00:29.080 --> 00:00:34.250
I can't fathom why such a wonderful story 
is considered low-brow reading in noble society.

00:00:34.590 --> 00:00:37.610
<i>I immersed myself in manga 
and anime in my previous life,</i>

00:00:37.610 --> 00:00:41.040
<i>so frankly, I was feeling 
starved for a good story.</i>

00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:44.930
<i>Oh, I wish I could talk 
about this with someone!</i>

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:48.050
Incidentally, you've received an invitation.

00:00:48.560 --> 00:00:50.060
An invitation?

00:00:50.780 --> 00:00:53.450
From Geordo and Alan?

00:00:53.450 --> 00:00:57.730
Huh... So the two of them 
are hosting a tea party.

00:00:57.730 --> 00:01:00.310
Then I bet lots of people will—

00:01:00.310 --> 00:01:03.120
That's it! This is the perfect chance!

00:01:03.390 --> 00:01:07.960
<i>I'm gonna find a fellow 
romance novel fan there!</i>

00:01:17.590 --> 00:01:20.300
<b>My Next Life as a Villainess:
All Routes Lead to Doom!</b>

00:02:38.290 --> 00:02:41.220
What? I've been invited to a tea party?

00:02:41.320 --> 00:02:43.640
Along with Nicol, of course.

00:02:41.390 --> 00:02:45.680
<b>Episode 3 
I Met a Beautiful Brother and Sister...</b>

00:02:44.260 --> 00:02:45.810
Brother...

00:02:47.280 --> 00:02:51.740
You need to get used to the outside world, 
even if only a little at a time.

00:02:51.740 --> 00:02:52.570
Understand?

00:03:05.340 --> 00:03:07.330
This is all awfully elaborate.

00:03:08.600 --> 00:03:11.050
Well, lots of guests will be attending.

00:03:11.050 --> 00:03:12.910
It must be the perfect tea party.

00:03:12.910 --> 00:03:16.000
Perfect, huh? Typical you.

00:03:16.250 --> 00:03:20.330
By the way, I guess there are 
things even you can't handle, huh?

00:03:21.730 --> 00:03:24.250
It's not that I can't handle them.

00:03:24.250 --> 00:03:26.350
I just don't like them that much.

00:03:26.350 --> 00:03:30.830
I thought there was nothing you couldn't handle, 
and nothing you couldn't do.

00:03:30.830 --> 00:03:32.140
Something I can't do?

00:03:32.140 --> 00:03:32.850
Yeah.

00:03:32.850 --> 00:03:37.880
Well, I'd say predicting what Catarina Claes 
will do is just about the only thing.

00:03:37.880 --> 00:03:40.360
That's... true, I guess.

00:03:41.310 --> 00:03:43.710
Just thinking about that face makes me...

00:03:46.110 --> 00:03:48.580
She is my fiancée, remember.

00:03:48.740 --> 00:03:51.120
Huh? Yeah, I know. So?

00:03:51.120 --> 00:03:52.910
No self-awareness, I see...

00:03:53.540 --> 00:03:56.450
Still, I have no intention 
of letting you have her.

00:04:03.060 --> 00:04:04.120
It's all right.

00:04:04.570 --> 00:04:07.890
You always say that, Brother.

00:04:24.990 --> 00:04:28.910
It's just as glamorous as you'd 
expect a royal tea party to be.

00:04:28.910 --> 00:04:30.280
You said it!

00:04:30.280 --> 00:04:33.410
And everything is so delicious!

00:04:38.450 --> 00:04:39.470
Sister?

00:04:39.470 --> 00:04:41.440
Excuse me for a moment.

00:04:45.720 --> 00:04:47.660
<i>My stomach is sloshing...</i>

00:04:47.660 --> 00:04:49.020
<i>But it's fine!</i>

00:04:49.020 --> 00:04:54.020
<i>I've learned to get to the bathroom 
before I hit my limit!</i>

00:04:55.970 --> 00:04:58.190
<i>A dog?! Why is there a dog here?!</i>

00:05:03.820 --> 00:05:06.000
Stay away!

00:05:06.000 --> 00:05:08.700
Leave me alone!

00:05:14.760 --> 00:05:18.410
It's finally gone. Now I can go 
to the bathroom...

00:05:17.270 --> 00:05:18.880
Do you even get it?

00:05:18.880 --> 00:05:21.660
You have some nerve showing up 
at a happy occasion like this.

00:05:21.660 --> 00:05:23.170
Yeah, since you're cursed!

00:05:23.170 --> 00:05:26.240
Cursed kids like you aren't welcome here!

00:05:23.180 --> 00:05:25.850
<i>There seems to be a big group over there...</i>

00:05:25.850 --> 00:05:27.180
<i>What do I do now?</i>

00:05:26.240 --> 00:05:30.350
I can't believe you'd even show 
yourself in public looking so creepy!

00:05:27.170 --> 00:05:31.320
<i>If I go down now, everyone will talk 
about how I was climbing trees!</i>

00:05:31.320 --> 00:05:33.190
<i>Just go away already!</i>

00:05:33.550 --> 00:05:36.680
<i>Hurry... Hurry! Ugh, 
I can't hold it any longer!</i>

00:05:36.680 --> 00:05:39.760
You're ruining the prince's tea party!

00:05:48.730 --> 00:05:51.070
Would you kindly get out of the way?

00:05:52.570 --> 00:05:55.250
Huh? Uh, you don't need to run...

00:06:03.970 --> 00:06:06.460
<i>She's so pretty...</i>

00:06:07.420 --> 00:06:08.760
Excuse me!

00:06:15.300 --> 00:06:17.270
<i>Where in the world did she go?</i>

00:06:17.270 --> 00:06:18.970
Look, it's Master Nicol!

00:06:19.390 --> 00:06:21.150
Oh, he's so adorable!

00:06:21.150 --> 00:06:22.410
He's beautiful.

00:06:22.410 --> 00:06:23.860
Just lovely.

00:06:23.860 --> 00:06:26.610
Master Nicol suffers so much 
on his sister's account.

00:06:26.610 --> 00:06:28.980
How painful it must be to hear him 
and his sister spoken of so.

00:06:28.980 --> 00:06:30.530
The poor thing.

00:06:35.240 --> 00:06:38.480
Now, which one should I eat next?

00:06:38.480 --> 00:06:40.020
E-Excuse me...

00:06:40.700 --> 00:06:43.450
Oh! You're that girl from before!

00:06:43.450 --> 00:06:46.180
<i>She really is beautiful!</i>

00:06:46.180 --> 00:06:49.340
<i>She looks like she could be in </i>Sophia 
and the Emerald Princess<i>!</i>

00:06:49.500 --> 00:06:52.370
<i>Sophia is a really beautiful girl.</i>

00:06:52.370 --> 00:06:54.340
<i>The princess sees her 
while sneaking out into town</i>

00:06:54.340 --> 00:06:56.560
<i>and is taken by her beauty.</i>

00:06:56.760 --> 00:06:59.180
U-Um, about what happened before...

00:06:59.320 --> 00:07:01.830
<i>Then the princess says to Sophia...</i>

00:07:01.830 --> 00:07:04.690
"Your hair is as lovely as silk."

00:07:05.050 --> 00:07:08.020
"Do you mind if I touch it, 
just for a moment?"

00:07:08.560 --> 00:07:09.450
Huh?

00:07:09.450 --> 00:07:12.720
Oh! Um, I was just, uh...

00:07:12.720 --> 00:07:14.370
The Emerald Princess?

00:07:15.060 --> 00:07:16.220
What?!

00:07:16.220 --> 00:07:20.910
A-A-A-A-Are you saying you know 
<i>Sophia and the Emerald Princess</i>?!

00:07:20.910 --> 00:07:22.140
U-Um...

00:07:22.140 --> 00:07:23.880
You do, don't you?!

00:07:24.020 --> 00:07:25.340
<i>Yes!</i>

00:07:25.340 --> 00:07:28.120
<i>I finally found a fellow romance novel fan!</i>

00:07:28.120 --> 00:07:29.070
Um...

00:07:29.880 --> 00:07:31.470
Please forgive me.

00:07:31.840 --> 00:07:34.200
My name is Catarina Claes.

00:07:34.200 --> 00:07:36.180
I'm Sophia Ascart.

00:07:36.180 --> 00:07:39.520
<i>No way! She's actually Sophia!</i>

00:07:39.670 --> 00:07:43.390
Lady Sophia! If you don't mind, 
let's have a nice, long chat!

00:07:43.580 --> 00:07:47.240
Sister, I'm sorry 
to interrupt your fun, but...

00:07:47.240 --> 00:07:49.280
The tea party is over.

00:07:49.280 --> 00:07:53.840
Aw, but we were just getting ready 
to converse about our shared passion!

00:07:53.840 --> 00:07:57.590
But, Lady Sophia, would you come 
to my house sometime?

00:07:57.590 --> 00:07:59.740
Huh? Um, okay...

00:07:59.740 --> 00:08:01.630
I'll be waiting!

00:08:03.570 --> 00:08:05.290
Sophia, I've been looking for you.

00:08:05.770 --> 00:08:07.440
Brother...

00:08:07.440 --> 00:08:11.630
That girl just invited me over to her house.

00:08:15.600 --> 00:08:17.600
Lady Catarina, you have—

00:08:18.970 --> 00:08:20.560
Thanks for coming, Lady Sophi—

00:08:23.360 --> 00:08:26.180
<i>Who is this boy of unparalleled beauty?!</i>

00:08:26.180 --> 00:08:27.400
Pleasure to meet you.

00:08:27.400 --> 00:08:30.480
Thank you for inviting my sister over to visit.

00:08:30.480 --> 00:08:33.990
I'm accompanying her. 
I'm her older brother, Nicol Ascart.

00:08:33.990 --> 00:08:35.470
<i>Her older brother?!</i>

00:08:35.470 --> 00:08:38.030
Thank you so much for coming.

00:08:38.030 --> 00:08:40.030
My name is Catarina Claes.

00:08:40.030 --> 00:08:42.370
<i>Wait... Nicol Ascart?</i>

00:08:43.380 --> 00:08:46.630
<i>This is it! The fourth doom flag!</i>

00:08:46.910 --> 00:08:49.690
<i>He's the son of the premier and
a childhood friend of Geordo and Alan.</i>

00:08:49.690 --> 00:08:51.500
<i>He's one year older and doesn't talk much,</i>

00:08:51.500 --> 00:08:53.420
<i>and he's another conquerable 
route in the game!</i>

00:08:54.730 --> 00:08:57.670
We did not play Nicol's 
route in our previous life.

00:08:57.670 --> 00:09:02.480
All we know about him is what we heard 
from our otaku friend Acchan.

00:09:02.480 --> 00:09:04.940
<i>Nicol's got a pretty 
hardcore sister complex,</i>

00:09:03.730 --> 00:09:09.690
<b>Ultimate Strategy Guide</b>

00:09:04.940 --> 00:09:06.920
<i>so your rival is his younger sister.</i>

00:09:06.920 --> 00:09:09.690
<i>That means you have to have to 
win over his sister first!</i>

00:09:09.690 --> 00:09:12.240
The rival in Nicol's route isn't Catarina.

00:09:09.690 --> 00:09:25.790
Emergency Meeting
What we know
about Nicol Ascart
Sister complex

00:09:12.240 --> 00:09:13.910
In other words, no matter 
how we interact with Nicol,

00:09:13.910 --> 00:09:16.200
it shouldn't set a doom flag!

00:09:16.200 --> 00:09:19.700
Then befriending Sophia 
shouldn't cause any problems.

00:09:19.700 --> 00:09:22.500
Not to mention she's our 
first fellow romance novel fan!

00:09:22.500 --> 00:09:24.860
Yeah, so we can't just let her slip by!

00:09:24.860 --> 00:09:26.920
Yeah!

00:09:29.210 --> 00:09:30.850
Oh, I'm sorry!

00:09:30.850 --> 00:09:34.050
As I was saying, 
thank you so much for coming!

00:09:53.650 --> 00:09:55.200
That was so great!

00:09:55.200 --> 00:09:56.230
Wasn't it?

00:09:56.230 --> 00:09:58.100
Your ride has arrived.

00:09:58.680 --> 00:10:00.340
Aw, already?

00:10:00.340 --> 00:10:02.830
Time sure flies when you're having fun, huh?

00:10:07.230 --> 00:10:09.630
Your hair really is pretty.

00:10:09.630 --> 00:10:11.610
May I touch it, just for a moment?

00:10:11.610 --> 00:10:12.380
Huh?

00:10:15.890 --> 00:10:17.680
<i>Now I've done it!</i>

00:10:17.680 --> 00:10:20.210
<i>Does she think I'm a freak now?!</i>

00:10:20.210 --> 00:10:21.970
Um, I mean...

00:10:22.160 --> 00:10:23.430
...to you?

00:10:23.430 --> 00:10:24.270
Huh?

00:10:25.500 --> 00:10:30.660
Lady Catarina... my appearance 
doesn't seem creepy to you?

00:10:30.930 --> 00:10:32.770
What do you mean?

00:10:33.510 --> 00:10:36.700
Since I have hair 
as white as an old person's

00:10:36.700 --> 00:10:38.840
and eyes as red as blood,

00:10:38.840 --> 00:10:42.450
everyone always says 
I'm a creepy-looking, cursed child.

00:10:42.450 --> 00:10:43.950
A cursed child?

00:10:43.950 --> 00:10:45.120
It's slander.

00:10:46.090 --> 00:10:49.090
People who are jealous of our family 
and our father's achievements

00:10:49.090 --> 00:10:50.840
resort to spreading insults about us.

00:10:50.840 --> 00:10:52.410
What?! That's...

00:10:52.410 --> 00:10:57.170
But that doesn't change the fact 
that my hair looks creepy.

00:10:57.170 --> 00:10:59.210
I think it's pretty, though!

00:11:00.670 --> 00:11:04.050
Your white hair is as beautiful as silk,

00:11:04.050 --> 00:11:06.790
and your red eyes twinkle like rubies.

00:11:06.790 --> 00:11:08.680
I think they're both beautiful!

00:11:09.130 --> 00:11:11.650
I hope you'll come to visit me again!

00:11:11.650 --> 00:11:13.190
And...

00:11:15.020 --> 00:11:18.820
If you wouldn't mind, would you be my friend?

00:11:27.020 --> 00:11:28.010
Yes!

00:11:33.860 --> 00:11:36.510
It almost feels like a dream.

00:11:36.510 --> 00:11:39.720
What you said really was true, Brother.

00:11:40.860 --> 00:11:42.280
Don't worry.

00:11:42.280 --> 00:11:47.740
Someday, you'll find a wonderful 
friend who understands you.

00:11:48.370 --> 00:11:52.980
I thought people like 
that only existed in books.

00:11:56.500 --> 00:11:57.600
I'm happy for you.

00:11:59.470 --> 00:12:02.740
<i>Sophia and I continued 
to see each other after that.</i>

00:12:02.990 --> 00:12:05.050
<i>Mary was hesitant at first,</i>

00:12:05.050 --> 00:12:07.580
<i>but even she can talk openly with her now.</i>

00:12:08.880 --> 00:12:10.780
This book was wonderful, too!

00:12:10.780 --> 00:12:12.420
It's part of the <i>Devilish Count</i> series!

00:12:12.540 --> 00:12:14.690
What is it about?

00:12:14.690 --> 00:12:18.510
It's a romance novel series about a 
beautiful count and a commoner girl.

00:12:18.640 --> 00:12:21.140
With his black hair and black eyes,

00:12:21.140 --> 00:12:26.530
the count has a devilish appeal 
that charms even men, let alone women.

00:12:26.800 --> 00:12:27.900
Oh, my!

00:12:27.900 --> 00:12:31.730
Actually, I think the count 
resembles my brother a bit,

00:12:31.730 --> 00:12:33.160
though I am rather biased.

00:12:33.160 --> 00:12:34.800
Yeah, I get it!

00:12:34.800 --> 00:12:37.070
Like how he's so quiet and mysterious...

00:12:37.070 --> 00:12:40.380
True. He does have a strange sort of charm.

00:12:40.380 --> 00:12:42.730
Would you let me borrow that book, too?

00:12:42.730 --> 00:12:45.090
And you can lend me another one!

00:12:45.090 --> 00:12:48.100
In that case, you should come 
to my house next time.

00:12:52.240 --> 00:12:54.140
Sister, calm down.

00:12:54.140 --> 00:12:55.940
I'm so excited!

00:12:55.940 --> 00:12:58.860
She said she has lots 
of great romance novels!

00:13:01.160 --> 00:13:04.640
It's a pleasure to meet you. 
I'm Nicol and Sophia's father.

00:13:04.770 --> 00:13:06.750
My name is Dan Ascart.

00:13:06.750 --> 00:13:08.970
I'm his wife, Radia Ascart.

00:13:08.970 --> 00:13:11.380
<i>It figures their parents 
would be gorgeous, too!</i>

00:13:13.870 --> 00:13:17.530
It's nice to meet you. 
My name is Catarina Claes.

00:13:17.530 --> 00:13:20.100
I'm her younger brother, Keith Claes.

00:13:20.230 --> 00:13:23.790
Our daughter has seemed so 
much happier since she met you.

00:13:23.790 --> 00:13:25.360
Thank you so much.

00:13:25.360 --> 00:13:29.490
We're truly glad Sophia has 
made a wonderful friend like you.

00:13:29.490 --> 00:13:31.740
Huh? Er... I'm happy to be her friend!

00:13:33.120 --> 00:13:36.280
Lady Catarina! Thank you for coming!

00:13:55.760 --> 00:13:58.270
Thank you for such a lovely time.

00:13:58.650 --> 00:14:01.130
And for lending me so many books, too.

00:14:01.130 --> 00:14:02.480
And thank you, too.

00:14:03.200 --> 00:14:08.910
Oh, no! I forgot the book 
I recommended to you in my room!

00:14:08.910 --> 00:14:10.360
There's always next time.

00:14:10.360 --> 00:14:13.430
No, I would love for you 
to read it as soon as possible.

00:14:13.430 --> 00:14:14.490
I'll go get it now!

00:14:16.210 --> 00:14:19.710
<i>Oh... This feels familiar...</i>

00:14:20.960 --> 00:14:23.610
I forgot the manga I recommended to you!

00:14:23.610 --> 00:14:26.140
Hang on a sec. I'll go get it.

00:14:30.510 --> 00:14:35.310
<i>I bet Sophia would have 
read manga, watched anime,</i>

00:14:35.310 --> 00:14:39.020
<i>and played otome games with me 
in the world I lived in before, too.</i>

00:14:39.440 --> 00:14:43.440
<i>I'm so glad I made such a wonderful friend.</i>

00:14:43.690 --> 00:14:46.830
Please allow me to thank you 
again on my sister's behalf.

00:14:46.830 --> 00:14:48.730
Thank you very much.

00:14:48.730 --> 00:14:50.410
No, I'm the one who's grateful.

00:14:50.410 --> 00:14:53.490
You've both been so kind to me,

00:14:53.490 --> 00:14:56.320
and your parents have been just as gracious.

00:14:56.320 --> 00:14:57.370
Our parents?

00:14:57.370 --> 00:15:00.510
Yes! You have such lovely parents!

00:15:00.510 --> 00:15:03.300
I see... Thank you.

00:15:06.910 --> 00:15:10.060
<i>What?! What is this awkward silence?!</i>

00:15:10.060 --> 00:15:12.710
<i>Let's see... How to make 
this conversation longer...</i>

00:15:12.710 --> 00:15:15.690
<i>How to keep this going...</i>

00:15:15.690 --> 00:15:17.730
<i>Oh! The old lady next door!</i>

00:15:17.730 --> 00:15:20.200
The old lady next door 
from our previous life.

00:15:20.200 --> 00:15:24.910
Once she started talking to someone, 
they were stuck for at least thirty minutes.

00:15:24.910 --> 00:15:28.860
<i>Lucky you, snagging 
yourself such a pretty wife!</i>

00:15:28.860 --> 00:15:31.240
Yes! We'll use a variation of that!

00:15:31.440 --> 00:15:35.430
With such lovely parents 
and such an adorable sister,

00:15:35.430 --> 00:15:38.420
you truly are blessed, Master Nicol.

00:15:39.100 --> 00:15:40.630
Blessed?

00:15:40.630 --> 00:15:42.590
Huh? U-Um...

00:15:42.940 --> 00:15:45.440
Do you really think I'm blessed?

00:15:45.440 --> 00:15:49.320
Yes! You have such 
a wonderful family, after all!

00:15:49.770 --> 00:15:52.520
Or... am I wrong?

00:15:55.650 --> 00:15:56.860
You aren't wrong.

00:15:57.950 --> 00:16:00.980
I'm truly blessed to have 
wonderful parents I can respect

00:16:00.980 --> 00:16:05.570
and a sweet, adorable little sister.

00:16:05.570 --> 00:16:07.610
<i>Wha... Wha... What?</i>

00:16:07.610 --> 00:16:10.350
<i>He looks even more gorgeous 
when he's smiling!</i>

00:16:10.350 --> 00:16:15.330
<i>This must be how the Devilish Count's 
"smile that can charm anyone" looks!</i>

00:16:15.480 --> 00:16:17.840
Sorry to keep you waiting, Lady Catarina!

00:16:17.840 --> 00:16:19.630
Here's the book.

00:16:19.630 --> 00:16:22.000
R-Right... Thank you.

00:16:22.260 --> 00:16:23.490
Well, we'll be...

00:16:26.740 --> 00:16:28.340
<i>Don't tell me...</i>

00:16:28.580 --> 00:16:32.930
<i>Has Nicol's devilish smile 
stolen Keith's heart, too?!</i>

00:16:32.930 --> 00:16:35.770
Well, we should be going now!

00:16:35.770 --> 00:16:37.620
Take care!

00:16:40.180 --> 00:16:42.680
Today was fun, wasn't it, Keith?

00:16:42.680 --> 00:16:44.210
It was, Sister.

00:16:46.600 --> 00:16:49.360
<i>Nicol's devilish charm 
is not to be underestimated!</i>

00:16:49.360 --> 00:16:52.190
<i>How am I going to protect Keith from now on?</i>

00:16:52.300 --> 00:16:54.970
<i>I can't believe I have yet another rival.</i>

00:16:54.970 --> 00:16:57.950
<i>Just how many people does 
she feel the need to win over?</i>

00:17:00.450 --> 00:17:12.260
<b>Secret
Catarina</b>

00:17:14.290 --> 00:17:18.890
<i>It's been seven years since the spring 
when I recalled my past life at age eight.</i>

00:17:19.070 --> 00:17:22.080
<i>I'm finally fifteen years old now.</i>

00:17:23.050 --> 00:17:24.350
Lady Catarina.

00:17:24.700 --> 00:17:26.420
Everyone has assembled.

00:17:26.420 --> 00:17:28.190
Please come to the hall now.

00:17:29.730 --> 00:17:35.490
<i>I've spent the past seven years doing 
everything I could to avoid my doom ending.</i>

00:17:35.490 --> 00:17:37.130
Don't let Keith be alone!

00:17:37.130 --> 00:17:38.930
Training in magic and the sword...

00:17:38.930 --> 00:17:42.700
Sadly, it seems we didn't have 
much magical talent after all...

00:17:42.700 --> 00:17:44.630
But we have ways to compensate.

00:17:53.930 --> 00:17:56.940
Happy birthday, Catarina.

00:17:57.300 --> 00:17:58.840
You look beautiful.

00:17:59.050 --> 00:18:00.200
Thank you.

00:18:02.610 --> 00:18:04.440
Happy birthday!

00:18:04.440 --> 00:18:05.420
Happy birthday.

00:18:05.420 --> 00:18:06.490
Thanks!

00:18:06.970 --> 00:18:08.720
<i>Everyone's grown up.</i>

00:18:08.720 --> 00:18:12.170
<i>They all look just like 
the characters in the game now.</i>

00:18:12.400 --> 00:18:15.170
Now, please share the first dance with me.

00:18:15.170 --> 00:18:16.360
With pleasure!

00:18:24.120 --> 00:18:27.070
Catarina, I know I told you this before,

00:18:27.070 --> 00:18:31.500
but I have no intention 
of breaking off our engagement.

00:18:31.640 --> 00:18:33.350
All right.

00:18:33.350 --> 00:18:37.570
But if anyone else ever catches 
your attention, just say so.

00:18:37.570 --> 00:18:39.760
I'll back off without putting up a fight.

00:18:39.760 --> 00:18:43.410
Right. I understand you 
don't understand at all.

00:18:43.410 --> 00:18:48.390
It might be faster for me to come up 
with a fait accompli right now.

00:18:48.390 --> 00:18:50.020
Fait accompli?

00:18:51.410 --> 00:18:53.320
Um, Prince Geordo?

00:18:54.450 --> 00:18:58.260
You may be another year older, 
but you're still as defenseless as ever.

00:18:58.260 --> 00:19:02.320
With you like this, I could 
easily take you at any time.

00:19:04.160 --> 00:19:05.080
<i>Huh?</i>

00:19:06.610 --> 00:19:09.310
I'll leave it at that for today,

00:19:09.310 --> 00:19:11.680
but someday, I will help 
myself to all of you.

00:19:16.280 --> 00:19:17.500
Sister, hold still!

00:19:17.500 --> 00:19:19.550
Huh? Keith, what are you doing?

00:19:19.550 --> 00:19:21.640
There was a bug. It left a spot on you.

00:19:21.640 --> 00:19:25.190
Oh, okay! So that was a bug! Thanks!

00:19:25.190 --> 00:19:27.480
<i>She's so dense. I worry about her.</i>

00:19:27.890 --> 00:19:29.250
Listen to me.

00:19:29.250 --> 00:19:32.670
Please avoid seeing Prince 
Geordo alone from now on.

00:19:32.670 --> 00:19:33.360
Huh?

00:19:33.360 --> 00:19:36.320
Oh, you must think I'm going to 
try to pull something again.

00:19:36.320 --> 00:19:39.200
Don't worry! As a noble lady, I'm fully—

00:19:39.200 --> 00:19:40.980
Are we clear?

00:19:40.980 --> 00:19:42.470
Uh... sure.

00:19:44.530 --> 00:19:47.690
Catarina, would you dance with me nex—

00:19:48.530 --> 00:19:50.200
What happened to your neck?

00:19:50.360 --> 00:19:53.120
Oh, a bug bit me a minute ago.

00:19:53.120 --> 00:19:54.050
A bug?

00:19:54.360 --> 00:19:58.740
Anyway, you look... well... 
better than usual today.

00:19:58.740 --> 00:20:00.220
Why, thank you.

00:20:00.330 --> 00:20:02.400
My servants worked hard to fix me up.

00:20:02.400 --> 00:20:05.540
They kept arranging and rearranging my dress, 
my hair, even my underwear...

00:20:05.540 --> 00:20:06.950
Whoa! Hey!

00:20:09.140 --> 00:20:11.530
Would you dance with me next?

00:20:11.530 --> 00:20:12.690
Yes!

00:20:12.690 --> 00:20:13.950
You look beautiful.

00:20:13.950 --> 00:20:16.050
Oh, thank you.

00:20:24.670 --> 00:20:27.570
You're so popular, Master Nicol.

00:20:29.910 --> 00:20:32.690
<i>He's still impossible 
to hold a conversation with!</i>

00:20:32.690 --> 00:20:34.060
Um...

00:20:34.060 --> 00:20:37.110
So is there anyone you're 
interested in yourself?

00:20:37.110 --> 00:20:38.060
Yes.

00:20:38.430 --> 00:20:40.570
Who is it?

00:20:40.830 --> 00:20:42.280
I can't tell you.

00:20:42.590 --> 00:20:44.840
It's someone I really 
shouldn't have feelings for.

00:20:44.840 --> 00:20:47.260
<i>Huh?! What, so it's forbidden love?!</i>

00:20:47.260 --> 00:20:49.550
<i>Someone's wife, then? Or maybe a guy?!</i>

00:20:49.670 --> 00:20:53.610
But I'm always wishing 
for that person's happiness.

00:20:53.610 --> 00:20:55.310
Master Nicol...

00:20:55.310 --> 00:20:57.310
I'm sure good things will come.

00:21:01.930 --> 00:21:03.360
Lady Catarina!

00:21:03.360 --> 00:21:07.790
It's no fair that only 
the boys get to dance with you.

00:21:07.790 --> 00:21:09.360
Want to dance with me, then?

00:21:09.360 --> 00:21:12.200
I can't dance the men's part, though.

00:21:12.200 --> 00:21:14.710
Well, I suspected this might happen,

00:21:14.710 --> 00:21:17.730
so I've been practicing both the men's 
and the women's parts.

00:21:17.730 --> 00:21:18.500
Huh?

00:21:18.980 --> 00:21:22.660
How unfair. I want to dance 
with you, too, Lady Catarina.

00:21:22.660 --> 00:21:23.800
Sophia...

00:21:23.800 --> 00:21:28.320
The last novel I read was a romance 
about a princess and a common town girl.

00:21:28.320 --> 00:21:32.850
The scene where the two girls 
danced together was so romantic!

00:21:32.850 --> 00:21:34.250
<i>Huh?!</i>

00:21:34.250 --> 00:21:36.990
<i>Sophia's getting deeper 
and deeper into this...</i>

00:21:36.990 --> 00:21:39.270
Okay! You can take turns, then!

00:21:45.420 --> 00:21:49.200
<i>And so, after a delightful 
fifteenth birthday party,</i>

00:21:49.200 --> 00:21:55.870
<i>the countdown to my entry 
into the magic academy begins.</i>

00:21:56.100 --> 00:21:57.840
<i>In other words...</i>

00:21:58.400 --> 00:22:02.170
<i>the otome game I've feared all 
this time is about to begin!</i>

00:22:02.380 --> 00:22:05.550
<i>I just hope I can avoid my own doom</i>

00:22:05.550 --> 00:22:08.590
<i>and stay with all of my friends forever...</i>
